# Faerie Mastermind: "{3}{U}: Each player draws a card." Bot1 activates it in its own turn 3 main phase: Bot1 (the active
# player, who has drawn once already that turn) and Bot2 each draw a card. Bot1's second draw of the turn does not trigger
# its own Mastermind ("an opponent draws"), and Bot2's draw is its first that turn, so nothing triggers and each hand
# gains exactly one card. Mastermind comes down on turn 1 with the Mox Sapphire's blue and a colorless from Sol Ring.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Faerie Mastermind
Island x3
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

